0..79 Comment "// A signature stated over a finite shape. The member `boundary Square { … }`"
80..159 Comment "// names the carrier the signature\'s cells are stated over, one name per point,"
160..236 Comment "// and each `face` member a face a cell may be fixed on, the subshape of the"
237..317 Comment "// names it holds (Schönlank, Nuyts and Devriese, _Towards FaceTT_, TYPES 2026:"
318..395 Comment "// the shape parameter `ft` and its subshapes). The points run in name order."
396..468 Comment "// The block\'s value codes the shape at the head of its sort chain, so a"
469..504 Comment "// program reads it back by `case`."
506..581 Comment "/// Cells over a square of four corners, top left to bottom right: its left"
582..653 Comment "/// and right sides, its top and bottom, one corner and the empty face."
